comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-24T08:24:38.157Z","harness:codex","Live reproduction: related-to-ceiling still blocks above 6053 even though canonical graph and declared-row semantic-share floors independently detect dilution. Implement the requested policy disposition by retaining the raw count as observation-only and enforcing the existing canonical graph semantic share in both graph-composition and tracker-context-quality. Keep declared-row semantic share diagnostic to avoid divergent denominator policies; do not change ordering-edge bounds. The accepted relationship ontology pm-4jqm already distinguishes truthful association from ordering and provenance."
  "2026-09-24T08:44:38.811Z","harness:codex","Complete all-status PM CLI census: 2801 items (2499 closed, 225 open, 59 draft, 14 canceled, 4 actively in progress), no omitted rows or unreadable sources. All items have hierarchy or dependency links; no dangling local dependency IDs. Recorded rows include 2936 implements, 1013 discovered_from, 589 verifies, 98 supersedes, 106 recurs_from and 21 incident_from alongside association and ordering. No historical relations were fabricated to inflate depth. Manual isolated research workflow passed custom-field and typed-link lifecycle roundtrip."
  "2026-09-24T08:54:36.697Z","harness:codex","The composition gate caught one newly mentioned Decision without a structured edge. Added the truthful implements link to the accepted relationship ontology; retained the existing prose-gap ceiling unchanged. Live canonical graph audit reports 13990 deduplicated directed edges, 1827 semantic edges (13.059 percent), no missing nodes, no isolated active nodes, and no ordering contradictions; only the seven pre-existing legacy hierarchy cases remain informational."
  "2026-09-24T08:57:57.488Z","harness:codex","Verification: PR #1295 hosted coverage artifact from run 35977528916 has exact 100/100/100/100: lines 62249/62249, statements 65109/65109, functions 13498/13498, branches 49725/49725, zero skipped counters. Four linked item suites pass. Initial local broad run exposed two now-corrected script contract expectations and a load-related census timeout; all 64 focused rerun tests passed without loosening timeouts."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-24T08:39:42.363Z","harness:codex",Use one canonical deduplicated graph ratio for composition enforcement. A raw associative count pinned to its observation makes honest context additions fail and incentivizes false relationship typing.
